{"unit_id":"Bene-2020__plane-dsh-plugin#card-zh","repo":"Bene-2020/plane-dsh-plugin","commit":"183f6125f9f4a09d2d2b2135606f896a23b23aba","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"plane-dsh-plugin 是面向 DSH Web 的 Plane 项目管理插件：它通过 Cordis host 和浏览器 client 接入工具、会话上下文、后台任务与全局悬浮面板。用户可以发现并绑定 Plane 项目、记录会话中的任务与进展事件、在本地 SQLite Outbox 暂存后异步同步，并在面板查看工作项、调整状态和重试失败批次。适合希望把 DSH 编码工作关联到 Plane 项目并持续跟踪的人。需要配置 Plane workspace、workspaceSlug 和 DSH credentials 中的 PLANE_API_KEY。","source":"generated","evidence":["packages/plugin/src/index.ts:25","packages/plugin/src/tools.ts:13","packages/plugin/src/worker.ts:43","packages/client/src/client/index.ts:30","packages/plugin/src/config.ts:5"]}
